Eigen is primarily licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. The complete
license text is retained in COPYING.MPL2.

The retained Tensor dependency subset also contains files under Apache-2.0 and
BSD-compatible terms. The corresponding license texts are retained in
COPYING.APACHE and COPYING.BSD, and per-file copyright and license notices are
preserved in the source files.

Define EIGEN_MPL2_ONLY when compiling to reject inclusion of Eigen code that is
not compatible with MPL-2.0-only use. This project defines that symbol for all
targets using this subset.
